(AtlasHub successfully demonstrates how digital technology can bring structure, safety, and operational excellence) Tj
T* (to an historically fragmented civil construction ecosystem. By introducing direct price negotiations, site stock burn) Tj
T* (monitoring, surplus material buybacks, fair wage protection, and explicit transit toll allocations, AtlasHub establishes) Tj
T* (a high standard for modern Indian construction platforms.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (All five stakeholder interfaces are fully operational, tested with end-to-end user workflows, and backed by a robust) Tj
